{"id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-q-fo.md","title":"FO Query","display":"df-fo-q-fo — FO Query","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-q-fo","aliases":["29-df-fo-q-fo"],"display":"df-fo-q-fo — FO Query","depends_on":["[[29-df-bit]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"§1.4, pp.18–19, DjVu scans 33–34","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-q-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-q-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-q-fo — FO Query"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§1.4, pp.18–19, DjVu scans 33–34"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\sigma\">\\(\\tau,\\sigma\\)</span> 为有限词汇。逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 由各词汇的句子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 及同构不变的满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 指定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\mathrm{FO}\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\mathrm{FO}\\)</span> 时，句子和满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有序接口使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 上的严格线性序。一般无序接口的词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 不受此保留符号限制。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L[&lt;]\">\\(\\mathcal L[&lt;]\\)</span> 在下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 记号中表示有序对输入的查询；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 是下式构造的真正带序结构，满足关系只作用于该结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 为有限非空模型类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}\">\\(\\mathrm{BIT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a> 的位位置在前、整数在后约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|\">\\(e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|\\)</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 递增的唯一双射。BIT 为新增符号，不属于输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}\">\\(\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\">\\(U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\)</span> 及相应模型类由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为存在唯一见证时的定描述符。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathcal L)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathcal L)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma^{\\mathrm{FO}}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma^{\\mathrm{FO}}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\bigr),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\bigr),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\coloneqq\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\coloneqq\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}}=\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}}=\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>FO 查询定义对应原书 §1.4，印刷页 18–19，扫描页 33–34。带逻辑上标与有序论域的两式是本库显式记号约定，用来表达原书的逻辑查询类；不得再用只接收 FO 句子的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau\\)</span> 接收 LFP/TC 句子，或遗漏新增的序解释。注意本库 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathcal L)\">\\(Q(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是逻辑的布尔查询类；原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(C)\">\\(Q(C)\\)</span> 也用于复杂性类的非布尔查询扩张，两者以参数类型区分。</p>\n<p>标准 BIT 扩张遵循原书 Proviso 1.14（印刷页13、扫描页28）：数值关系由序编号决定。模型类保留有序输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 本身，避免把数值扩张结构集合与以原输入为对象的电路查询集合比较。本轮明确展开有序对到带序结构的映射；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,L)\">\\((A,L)\\)</span> 直接传给只接受结构的满足关系。两个定描述的存在唯一性来自给定载体及每个词汇符号的唯一解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span> 和 BIT 新鲜性排除重复解释冲突。正文其他原子用字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 代指有序输入时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\">\\(A^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\)</span> 是该输入对的同一扩张接口，不是任意嵌套有序对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bit]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=\\mathrm{FO}$ 时，句子和满足关系取 [[29-df-sentence]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=\\mathrm{FO}$ 时，句子和满足关系取 [[29-df-sentence]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有序接口使用 $<\\notin\\tau$，$U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$，见 [[29-df-ordering]]；$L$ 是 $|A|$ 上的严格线性序。一般无序接口的词汇 $\\sigma$ 不受此保留符号限制。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]$ 为有限非空模型类，见 [[29-df-struc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BIT}$ 取 [[29-df-bit]] 的位位置在前、整数在后约定；$n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)$，$e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|$ 为按 $L$ 递增的唯一双射。BIT 为新增符号，不属于输入 $\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}$。$U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}$ 及相应模型类由下式构造；$\\iota$ 为存在唯一见证时的定描述符。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\mathrm{FO}","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L[<]","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIT}","display":false},{"tex":"n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"e_U:[n_U]\\to|A|","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma].","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\mathcal L)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\sigma}^{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mod}_\\sigma^{\\mathrm{FO}}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\sigma}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land <^B=L\\bigr),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,<}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}].","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\mathcal L[<])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\tau}^{\\mathcal L,<}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\coloneqq\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n_U],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\;\\bigl(|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_{\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}}=\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\mathrm{BIT}^U\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,<,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid U^{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}].","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\mathcal L[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathcal L,<,\\mathrm{BIT}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau\\cup\\{<,\\mathrm{BIT}\\}]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"Q(C)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"(A,L)",